        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le strutture dati ad albero come quella qui sotto vengono comunemente usate nello sviluppo di giochi per rappresentare dati e relazioni in modo <strong>gerarchico</strong>.</p><p>Nei giochi, un grafo della scena ci aiuta a vedere come sono collegati sprite, UI ed effetti.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamiamo ogni elemento di un albero un <strong>nodo</strong>, come un nodo sprite <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rappresentiamo gli oggetti in una scena di gioco come <strong>nodi</strong> dell'albero. Ad esempio, una <code>scene</code> e uno <code>sprite</code> sono <strong>nodi</strong> dell'albero.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HP: 100 \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;layer name=\"game\"&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;sprite name=\"player\"&gt;</code> e poi <code>&lt;/sprite&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/layer&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esistono diversi tipi di nodi. Chiamiamo <code>scene</code> il <strong>nodo radice</strong> perché è l'inizio dell'albero.</p><p>Può esserci un solo <strong>nodo radice</strong> di livello principale.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli elementi come <code>sprite</code> sono chiamati <strong>nodi elemento</strong>. Consideriamo l'etichetta all'interno di un <strong>nodo di testo</strong>, anche se non contiene <code>&lt;</code> e <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni porzione di testo nel markup della scena appare come un nodo di testo. Ad esempio, i testi in <code>title</code> e nell'<code>label</code> dell'HUD sono nodi di testo.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Dungeon Dash\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Score: 0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Dungeon Dash</code>, seguito da <code>Score:</code> e infine <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per cosa usiamo le strutture dati ad albero?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per rappresentare dati e relazioni in modo gerarchico</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rappresentare i dati in modo lineare</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per rappresentare dati e relazioni in modo gerarchico.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
